{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/short.gif?t=1745220884\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pop, Subtract, and Score your way to Victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Subtracto</strong> is a minimalist number puzzle game where quick thinking and sharp decisions lead to high scores.<br>Click or drag colorful balls to subtract their values from the Main Number, reach zero and score big. But beware! Go below zero and you'll lose precious time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the challenge escalates,  reach target scores, multiply your score with powerful multipliers and unlock new game sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast, focused, and surprisingly addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subtracto is math made fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard &amp; Mouse, but able to play with Mouse Control Only</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665780?t=1745220884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/933a7e5a42f347640eeac6af0798b3ffae811cf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745220884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/0368bdad90fb8618e75fdbcfb317078a2433da84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745220884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/0368bdad90fb8618e75fdbcfb317078a2433da84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745220884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto